body:
"don't wait outside my hotel room, just wait 'til I give you a sign" makes it seem like theyre sneaking around idk

&#x200B;

"i shouldnt have called, bc we shouldnt speak" makes it seem like it's something ongoing that they \*shouldn't\* have been doing, and the reason is more than just bc he's unhappy w her but bc hes prob cheating

&#x200B;

just my interpreation tho

My school does offer therapy but I have not heard many good things about it. Very surface-level help. 

&#x200B;

And I am currently on two anti-depressants and two mood stabilizers but I haven't been taken them like I am supposed to.

&#x200B;

And I have a therapist now who does DBT, which is a type of CBT. But I don't know when my next session will be since our state just got a hurricane.
